        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>2024 Environmental Progress Report - Report highlights</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-width: 1180px;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #f0f0f6;\n      color: #373737;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      padding: 58px 96px 88px;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: 2832px;\n      max-width: calc(100vw - 192px);\n      min-width: 1080px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .report-header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      color: #747474;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .navigation {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 31px;\n    }\n\n    .navigation span {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .navigation .active {\n      color: #343434;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #22b64b;\n    }\n\n    .report-meta {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 36px;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 221px 0 68px;\n      font-size: 102px;\n      line-height: 0.98;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      font-weight: 650;\n      color: #343434;\n    }\n\n    .highlights-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n      grid-template-rows: 530px 558px;\n      gap: 44px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n    }\n\n    .card {\n      min-width: 0;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #fff;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .card-content {\n      padding: 31px 39px;\n    }\n\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 17px;\n      color: #393939;\n      font-size: 38px;\n      line-height: 1.13;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      font-weight: 650;\n    }\n\n    p {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: #777;\n      font-size: 22px;\n      line-height: 1.39;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    sup {\n      position: relative;\n      top: -0.15em;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 0;\n    }\n\n    .read-more {\n      margin-top: 17px;\n      color: #3c3c3c;\n      font-size: 22px;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n      font-weight: 650;\n    }\n\n    .read-more a {\n      color: inherit;\n      text-decoration-line: underline;\n      text-decoration-color: #20bb4f;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n      text-underline-offset: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .emissions-card {\n      grid-column: 1;\n      grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-rows: 573px 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .emissions-card .card-content {\n      padding: 31px 39px 28px;\n    }\n\n    .emissions-card h2 {\n      font-size: 38px;\n    }\n\n    .emissions-card .placeholder {\n      border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;\n    }\n\n    .product-card {\n      grid-column: 2 / span 2;\n      grid-row: 1;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .product-card .card-content {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 2;\n      width: 52%;\n      height: 100%;\n      padding: 31px 39px;\n    }\n\n    .product-card .placeholder {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 1;\n      top: 95px;\n      right: 47px;\n      width: 44%;\n      height: 360px;\n      border: 0;\n      background: #f7f7f7;\n    }\n\n    .advocacy-card {\n      grid-column: 4;\n      grid-row: 1;\n    }\n\n    .materials-card {\n      grid-column: 5;\n      grid-row: 1;\n    }\n\n    .macbook-card {\n      grid-column: 2;\n      grid-row: 2;\n    }\n\n    .suppliers-card {\n      grid-column: 3;\n      grid-row: 2;\n    }\n\n    .forecast-card {\n      grid-column: 4 / span 2;\n      grid-row: 2;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 52% 48%;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .forecast-card .placeholder {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: 10px 0 0 10px;\n    }\n\n    .forecast-card .card-content {\n      padding: 31px 39px 31px 29px;\n    }\n\n    .placeholder {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border: 1px solid #c9c9c9;\n      background: #e2e2e2;\n      color: #666;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 1700px) {\n      body {\n        padding: 36px 48px 64px;\n      }\n\n      .page {\n        max-width: none;\n      }\n\n      .highlights-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 500px);\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"report-header\">\n      <nav class=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Report sections\">\n        <span>Contents</span>\n        <span class=\"active\">Introduction</span>\n        <span>Environmental Initiatives</span>\n        <span>Engagement and Advocacy</span>\n        <span>Data</span>\n        <span>Appendix</span>\n      </nav>\n      <div class=\"report-meta\">\n        <span>2024 Environmental Progress Report</span>\n        <span>4</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <h1>Report highlights</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"highlights-grid\">\n      <article class=\"card emissions-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-content\">\n          <h2>Reduced our overall emissions by more than 55 percent</h2>\n          <p>We reduced our overall greenhouse gas emissions across scopes 1, 2, and 3 by more than 55 percent compared with our 2015 baseline year — not including offsets.<sup>1</sup> In that same time period, revenue grew by 64 percent. We estimate that we’ve avoided 31 million metric tons of emissions through reduction efforts like transitioning our supply chain to renewable electricity and sourcing recycled content.</p>\n          <p class=\"read-more\">Read more on <a href=\"#\">page 14</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"Aerial photograph of Apple Park\">\n          <figcaption>[Photo: aerial view of Apple Park]</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card product-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-content\">\n          <h2>Introduced our most significant product emissions reductions to-date</h2>\n          <p>Innovations in design and clean energy drove dramatic reductions in greenhouse gas emissions for the fall Apple Watch lineup — the most significant from our business-as-usual scenario.<sup>2</sup> This included 100 percent clean energy for manufacturing and product use, 30 percent recycled and renewable material by weight, and 50 percent shipping without the use of air transportation.<sup>3</sup></p>\n          <p class=\"read-more\">Read more on <a href=\"#\">page 9</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"Apple Watch with braided band\">\n          <figcaption>[Product image: Apple Watch with braided band]</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card advocacy-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-content\">\n          <h2>Advocated for reporting transparency</h2>\n          <p>As part of our commitment to greenhouse gas emissions disclosures, we endorsed the landmark California Climate Corporate Data Accountability Act (CA SB 253) to improve transparency and drive progress in the fight against climate change.</p>\n          <p class=\"read-more\">Read more on <a href=\"#\">page 71</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card materials-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-content\">\n          <h2>Increased our use of recycled materials</h2>\n          <p>We’re making steady progress on our journey toward using only recycled and renewable materials in our products. In 2023, 22 percent of the materials we shipped in Apple products came from recycled sources.<sup>4</sup> This includes, 99 percent of tungsten, 71 percent of aluminum, 52 percent of cobalt, 25 percent of gold, and 24 percent of lithium in our products.<sup>5</sup></p>\n          <p class=\"read-more\">Read more on <a href=\"#\">page 17</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card macbook-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-content\">\n          <h2>MacBook Air is the first Apple product made with 50 percent recycled content</h2>\n          <p>This includes 100 percent recycled aluminum in the enclosure, 100 percent recycled rare earth elements in all magnets and, in another first for Apple, 100 percent recycled copper in the main logic board.</p>\n          <p class=\"read-more\">Read more on <a href=\"#\">page 16</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card suppliers-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-content\">\n          <h2>More than 320 suppliers committed to renewable electricity</h2>\n          <p>As of March 2024, more than 320 suppliers have committed to sourcing renewable electricity for Apple production, representing 95 percent of our direct supplier spend. We’ve accelerated progress with a mandate in our Supplier Code of Conduct for all direct suppliers to transition to renewable energy in the manufacturing of Apple products.</p>\n          <p class=\"read-more\">Read more on <a href=\"#\">page 27</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card forecast-card\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"iPhone displaying Grid Forecast in the Home app\">\n          <figcaption>[Product image: iPhone displaying Grid Forecast]</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <div class=\"card-content\">\n          <h2>Launched Grid Forecast</h2>\n          <p>In the contiguous United States, we introduced Grid Forecast, a new tool in the Home app on Apple devices. This tool shows customers when cleaner electricity is available from the grid, empowering them with information to help reduce greenhouse gas emissions.</p>\n          <p class=\"read-more\">Read more on <a href=\"#\">page 30</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
